| Column                 | Data Type | Description                                                 |
| ---------------------- | --------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| `employee_id`          | Text      | Unique identifier assigned to each employee                 |
| `full_name`            | Text      | Employee name                                               |
| `department_id`        | Text      | Identifier for the employee's department                    |
| `job_level`            | Text      | Employee's organizational/job level                         |
| `gender`               | Text      | Employee gender                                             |
| `tenure_years`         | Decimal   | Number of years the employee has been with the organization |
| `salary`               | Integer   | Employee annual salary                                      |
| `satisfaction_score`   | Decimal   | Employee satisfaction score                                 |
| `performance_rating`   | Text      | Employee performance rating/category                        |
| `manager_id`           | Text      | Identifier of the employee's manager                        |
| `hire_date`            | Date      | Date the employee joined the organization                   |
| `employment_status`    | Text      | Current employment status                                   |
| `last_promotion_years` | Integer   | Number of years since the employee's last promotion         |
| `Age`                  | Integer   | Employee age                                                |
| `Tenure Band`          | Text      | Categorized employee tenure                                 |
| `Salary Band`          | Text      | Categorized salary range                                    |
| `Age Group`            | Text      | Categorized employee age group                              |
